<tr height="400" valign="top" >
<td style=" color:#000000; font-size:12pt; background-color:#FFFFFF; font-family:arial; bLabel:main; bEditID:r3st1;" tEditID="c1r1" locked="0" aEditID="c1r1" >
<![CDATA[<div><div><font face="arial">Hello {!Contact.FirstName},&nbsp;</font></div><div><font face="arial">&nbsp;</font></div><div><font face="arial">Congratulations and welcome to the Sun Devil family! &nbsp;By paying your enrollment deposit, you have taken the next step to becoming an official Sun Devil.</font></div><div><font face="arial">&nbsp;</font></div><div><font face="arial">Now that you’ve confirmed your <b>housing preferences</b>, you can sign up for <b>orientation </b>in <a href="http://my.asu.edu/">My ASU</a>.&nbsp;</font></div><div><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div><font face="arial">All admitted first-time freshmen are expected to attend <a href="https://eoss.asu.edu/orientation">orientation</a>. Reservations are taken on a first-come, first-served basis and program dates fill quickly. Once a program has filled, that program date is no longer available and will not appear for reservations.&nbsp;</font></div><div><font face="arial">&nbsp;</font></div><div><font face="arial">Keep checking your <b>Priority Tasks</b> in <a href="http://my.asu.edu/">My ASU</a> and complete items as soon as possible to enroll at ASU.</font></div><div><font face="arial">&nbsp;</font></div><div><font face="arial">If you have any questions about the admission process or ASU in general, I'd be happy to help you in any way I can.&nbsp;</font></div><div><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div><font face="arial">We look forward to seeing you at ASU.&nbsp;</font></div><div><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div><font face="arial">Go Devils!</font></div><div><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div><font face="arial">{!User.Recruiter_Full_Name__c}</font></div><div><font face="arial">{!User.Recruiter_Title__c}</font></div><div><font face="arial">Admission Services</font></div><div><font face="arial">{!User.Recruiter_Email__c}</font></div><div><font face="arial">{!User.Recruiter_Phone__c}</font></div></div><div><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div><div style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: medium;"><font face="arial" size="2" color="#666666">If you have any additional information or questions related to this, please reply to this email.</font></div><div style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: medium;"><font face="arial" size="2" color="#666666"><br></font></div><div style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: medium;"><font face="arial" size="2" color="#666666">{!Case.Thread_Id}</font></div></div>]]></td>
</tr>
</table>